    <briefdescription>
<para>DelayBlock Low Layer HAL module driver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>MCD Application Team <verbatim>     This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
     functionalities of the Delay Block peripheral:
      + input clock frequency range 25MHz to 208MHz
      + up to 12 oversampling phases
</verbatim></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="attention"><para></para>
</simplesect>
